@# The cafe has authored job actions; other shop and food hubs are implicit.

:: place.cafe
@hub cafe

The quiet clatter of cups fills {{place.name}}.

@choicegroup ""
  
@choice "Ask about a job" -> cafe.job.application
  @when not flags.cafe_employee
@endchoice

@choice "Work for one hour" -> @exit
  @time 1h
  @event-pool cafe.job.shift
  @when flags.cafe_employee and time.minutesSinceMidnight >= 420 and time.minutesSinceMidnight <= 1260
  @change money 7 "£7 wages"
@endchoice
@endchoicegroup
